      "code": "import numpy as np                 # 模块别名\nfrom numpy import array as arr     # 名字别名\nfrom collections import OrderedDict as OD\n\n# 包也一样：import 包.子模块\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\n\n# ⚠ from m import * 会把名字摊进当前作用域，容易撞名",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">as</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> np                 </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 模块别名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">from</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> array </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">as</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> arr     </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 名字别名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">from</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> OrderedDict </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">as</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> OD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># 包也一样：import 包.子模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> xml</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">etree</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">ElementTree </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">as</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> ET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># ⚠ from m import * 会把名字摊进当前作用域，容易撞名</span></span></code></pre>",
